# SHA-256 of every external tool artifact this project pins.
#
# A pinned version without a checksum pins a NAME, not an ARTIFACT: upstream can
# re-cut a release under the same version string and nothing would notice. These
# hashes are what make the pin mean something.
#
# Verify (from the repo root):
#   sha256sum -c tools/CHECKSUMS.sha256
# or, without coreutils:
#   python -c "import hashlib,sys;print(hashlib.sha256(open(sys.argv[1],'rb').read()).hexdigest())" <file>
#
# The archives themselves are NOT committed (see .gitignore) -- they are 38 MB and
# recoverable from the URLs below. This file plus tools/VERSIONS.txt is the record.

# --- Windows (this machine) -------------------------------------------------------
